From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:09:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] dl-folds checkpoint 3: group E (iterate and emit, NM
 leftovers)

- E1: Games.iterEmit with iterEmit_eq, length_iterate_le_add, polyTimeComputable_iterEmit and
  iterEmit_encode beside relabelN (Games/Efficiency/OracleBridge.lean); NMCCA2.logEmit and
  NMSim.chunkMap redefined as instances, their lemmas derived from the generic facts; relabelN and
  relabel kept with the bridging equations relabelN_eq_iterEmit, relabel_eq_iterEmit, and
  bridgePre_poly derived from polyTimeComputable_iterEmit
- E2: NMCCA2.polyTimeComputable_guessBit (Encrypt.lean); the private polyTimeComputable_guessFun
  uses it; NMSim's copy deleted
- E3: FixedLengthPKScheme.ctLen_pos and indImpl_eq_of_msgLen_eq_zero (OracleSecurity.lean)
